### Config files ###
# Local dev config may hold a local DB password -> excluded (see *.example).
# Base + prod config carry NO secrets (prod uses env-var placeholders) -> committed so the
# deployed artifact contains them. Real secrets are injected as env vars at runtime.
src/main/resources/application-local.properties

